Address Space Isolation
============

This is a working branch for the latest upstream version of ASI.

Commits in here have lots of garbage in the commit message that needs to be
cleaned out.

This is a version of ASI with out local-nonsensitive, and without any attempt to
mitigate cross-SMT attacks.

